data: {"id": "30d0037009aa481b-thinking-parallel_evidence-616", "run_id": "30d0037009aa481b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=557 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [analyze] 综合分析: 结合 k8s 事实与已采集 Me", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789135128609, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_a76bbec2df434d639af23158", "tool_sequence": 6, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=557 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 4 completed, 1 in progress, 0 pending\n[~] [analyze] 综合分析: 结合 k8s 事实与已采集 Metrics/Logging/Topology 基线，输出简短证据结论\n[✓] [plan-1-describe-pod] plan-1-describe-pod: 确认当前状态、重启次数、Last State Reason 和 Exit Code\n[✓] [plan-2-get-pod-yaml] plan-2-get-pod-yaml: 验证容器启动配置、镜像、资源限制和入口命令\n[✓] [plan-3-previous-logs] plan-3-previous-logs: 提取崩溃前的错误堆栈或配置报错\n[✓] [plan-4-pod-events] plan-4-pod-events: 识别导致重启或等待状态的具体事件原因\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/30d0037009aa481b-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/30d0037009aa481b-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/30d0037009aa481b-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

